# Build context hygiene for tools/claude/Containerfile (build context = repo root).
# The builder stage COPYs the workspace source to compile code-graph-mcp; keep
# the context lean so the image build doesn't drag in build outputs, the local
# cargo/registry cache, the on-disk graph cache, VCS metadata, or the large
# external/ dogfood corpora (test fixtures, not build inputs).
target/
.cache/
.git/
.idea/
.code-graph-cache.db
.code-graph-cache.json
.code-graph.toml
external/
dist/
# Generated plugin trees for other agent harnesses. This image ships Claude Code
# only and COPYs `plugin/` (their canonical source), so these are never build
# inputs — see CLAUDE.md, "Agent-harness plugin trees".
.codex-plugin/
opencode-plugin/
